---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="What The Trend Times collects when you read the site or email us, how advertising cookies work, and how to opt out."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-11-04')}
	updatedDate={new Date('2026-11-04')}
	eyebrow="PRIVACY POLICY"
	showDate={false}
>
	<p>
		This policy covers thetrendtimes.com ("the site"), run by The Trend Times ("we", "us"). It explains what data
		we collect, why, and the choices you have. Questions go to
		<a href="mailto:contact@thetrendtimes.com">contact@thetrendtimes.com</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>What we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Server and security logs.</strong> The site runs on Cloudflare. When you load a page, Cloudflare processes
			your IP address, browser type, and the page requested to deliver the site and block abuse. See the
			<a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Fonts.</strong> Pages load fonts from Google Fonts, so your browser sends your IP address to Google when
			fetching them.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Email you send us.</strong> If you email us, we keep your address and message to reply. If you ask to join
			the newsletter, we keep your address until you unsubscribe.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>We do not sell personal data, and we do not ask for accounts or passwords.</p>

	<h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
	<p>
		We may show ads served by Google AdSense. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on
		your prior visits to this site and other sites. Google's use of advertising cookies lets it and its partners serve
		ads to you based on those visits.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			You can turn off personalized ads in
			<a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noopener">Google My Ad Center</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			You can opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at
			<a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			Google explains how it uses data from partner sites in
			<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services</a>.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		If you visit from the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, or Switzerland, we ask for your consent before
		any advertising cookies are set. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings.
	</p>

	<h2>How long we keep data</h2>
	<p>
		We keep email correspondence for as long as needed to answer it and for our records. Newsletter addresses are
		deleted when you unsubscribe. Cloudflare and Google keep their logs under their own policies.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights</h2>
	<p>
		You can ask us what personal data we hold about you, and ask us to correct or delete it. Email
		<a href="mailto:contact@thetrendtimes.com?subject=Privacy%20request">contact@thetrendtimes.com</a> with the subject line
		"Privacy request".
	</p>

	<h2>Children</h2>
	<p>The site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>

	<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
	<p>When we change this policy, we update the date at the top of this page.</p>
</Layout>
